{"id":"povtorno","lemma":"повторно","pos":"adv","rank":4956,"glosses":["repeatedly, iteratively (done several times)"],"examples":[{"text":"Я рассмотрю вопрос повторно.","en":"I'll reconsider the matter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/651050","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to look at","l":"рассмотреть"},{"g":"question"},null]},{"text":"Эти бутылки можно использовать повторно.","en":"These bottles are reusable.","words":[{"g":"this/that one","l":"этот"},{"g":"bottle","l":"бутылка"},{"g":"one can, one may"},{"g":"to use, to apply"},null]},{"text":"Она повторно вышла замуж, когда ей было за сорок.","en":"She remarried when she was in her mid-forties.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},null,{"g":"to exit, to go out","l":"выйти"},{"g":"married"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"(to) her"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"forty"}]},{"text":"Поскольку я не получил ответа, я написал ей повторно.","en":"Since I didn't receive a reply, I wrote to her again.","words":[{"g":"inasmuch as, as"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to receive, to get","l":"получить"},{"g":"answer","l":"ответ"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to write","l":"написать"},{"g":"(to) her"},null]}]}